ry of locations:**\n*   **Page 6 (Fig 3):** Visual basal points for literature average data.\n*   **Page 10 (Table 1):** Numeric mean/SD basal values for the virtual populations.\n*   **Page 3 (Eq 2):** The mathematical usage of these basal values.",
